			"Legal. Same-sex sexual activity was decriminalized in 2012. In 2021, the age of consent was equalized to 18 for all. In a significant move for the region, the 2019 Labour Code explicitly prohibits workplace discrimination based on sexual orientation. As of the January 2026 UN Universal Periodic Review, the country has maintained its position as a regional leader in LGBTQ+ rights, although same-sex marriage and legal gender recognition are still not available.",
