			"Militantly Hostile. The AHA 2023 was passed with near-unanimous public and political support. In 2025/2026, the social environment is characterized by fear and a 'neighbor-reporting-neighbor' culture. Religious leaders are the primary drivers of this sentiment. The local community has been decimated, with most activists in exile. There is no tolerance for 'different' identities, and the state actively encourages citizens to report 'suspected' homosexuals.",
